      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are a procurement expert.\n\nAnalyze the contract details and provide a short, clear renewal recommendation.\n\nSupplier: {{$json.SupplierName}}\nContract Value: {{$json.ContractValue}}\nDays to Expiry: {{$json.DaysToExpiry}}\nRisk Level: {{$json.RiskLevel}}\nPerformance Score: {{$json.PerformanceScore}}\nPriority Level: {{$json.PriorityLevel}}\n\nInstructions:\n- Keep the answer simple and professional\n- Do NOT use bold, symbols, or markdown\n- Keep each section 1–2 lines only\n\nFormat:\n\nRecommendation:\n(renew / renegotiate / review carefully)\n\nReason:\n(short explanation)\n\nRisk:\n(short risk warning if any)\n\nNext Step:\n(what should be done now)",
