    {
      "id": "72cfced0-cb0f-4ca1-a64e-da86912ced2f",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -432,
        -32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 896,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "# Contract Expiry & Renewal Radar Workflow  \n\n## How it works:  \n\nThis workflow automatically tracks contract expiration dates and identifies upcoming renewals that require attention. It first filters unprocessed and valid contract records, then calculates the number of days remaining until expiry. A scoring-based logic evaluates each contract using value, risk level, performance score, and urgency to determine priority. High-priority contracts are further analyzed using AI to generate clear and actionable renewal strategies. Critical cases trigger Slack alerts for immediate stakeholder attention, while medium and low-priority contracts are marked for monitoring. Invalid data is flagged and reported separately. All processed records are updated in Google Sheets, ensuring accurate tracking, better decision-making, and proactive contract management.  \n\n## Setup Steps:  \n\n1. Trigger Workflow  \nRun manually or schedule using a Cron Trigger.  \n\n2. Data Collection  \nFetch contract records from Google Sheets.  \n\n3. Data Filtering  \nProcess only unprocessed and valid contract entries.  \n\n4. Expiry Calculation  \nCalculate days remaining until contract expiry.  \n\n5. Priority Scoring  \nEvaluate contracts based on value, risk, performance, and urgency.  \n\n6. Decision Logic  \nIdentify high-priority renewals using IF node.  \n\n7. AI Insights  \nGenerate renewal recommendations for critical contracts.  \n\n8. Action & Storage  \nSend Slack alerts for high-priority cases and update all records in Google Sheets.  "
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
